Automatically changes ihud highlight colors from SAR to match their bot. 
Atlas has a general blue highlight along with m1/m2 corresponding to his portal colors. 
P-body has a general orange highlight along with m1/m2 corresponding to her portal colors.

To utilize these files, make sure that you have SAR installed and ihud is enabled (disabled by default), then run them in console. 

If you want to change any of these colors, for example if you change their portal colors, you can open the .cfg file in a text editor such as notepad or VS code and change the preloaded hex code.
